msgid "AI Act Image Labels"
msgstr "AI Act Image Labels"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "https://engenty.ai/ai-act-labels"
msgstr "https://engenty.ai/ai-act-labels"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid ""
"Marks AI-generated and AI-modified media as the EU AI Act asks – right in "
"the media library, with the EU's official icons on the site, and an "
"assistant that finds what needs a label."
msgstr ""
"Märker AI-genererad och AI-ändrad media så som EU:s AI-förordning kräver – "
"direkt i mediabiblioteket, med EU:s officiella ikoner på webbplatsen, och en"
" assistent som hittar det som behöver märkas."

#. Author of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "engenty"
msgstr "engenty"

